\ AOT regression test for lib/net/http.1z and its dependency closure.
\ The full networked driver lives at
\ tests/integration/http_server_example.1z; this file exercises a
\ narrow slice of the surface so the regression runs without spawning
\ a listener.
\
\ Importing net/http drags its dependency closure (lib/strings.1z,
\ lib/os/path.1z, lib/mimetype.1z, lib/net/server.1z, lib/net/tcp.1z,
\ lib/net.1z) through the freeze frontend and IR codegen, so any
\ backslide on the missing-stack-effect or row-variable-effect fixes
\ surfaces as a build failure. reason-for additionally drives the
\ parse-time status-reasons mutable-map literal through the
\ runtime-image slot table at execution time.

use "net/http" ;

200 reason-for print-line
404 reason-for print-line
500 reason-for print-line
999 reason-for print-line
